vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小红书联手北大上交发布HYPIC，为混合注意力大模型实现位置无关缓存</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删本地文件风险，建议关闭高权限模式</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">NVIDIA发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列模型，8B版本登顶RTEB检索基准</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026发布全球首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo样机</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/68fe962e114badc8c6fcdc554476836c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月17日，阶跃星辰在WAIC 2026正式展示全球首款大模型原生智能体手机STEPX Neo样机。该设备搭载智能体原生系统Step AOS，内置阶跃智能体Amoo，旨在实现AI Agent与移动终端的深度融合。系统界面包含“水产市场”、“灵魂设定”及“AI智能体安全”等模块，其中“灵魂设定”用于记录用户个性与偏好，使智能体具备长期记忆与个性化交互能力。现场演示显示，Amoo可自主完成任务规划与工具调用，如查询演唱会门票并联动携程完成酒店预订。阶跃星辰表示，STEPX Neo正推动AI手机从语音助手向具备任务执行能力的智能体平台演进。目前该产品仍处于样机阶段，完整形态与功能细节将后续公布。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度秒哒3.5版本发布：支持iOS无代码打包与多端共享后端</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/034a29d8fcf2e23d0ffaddea6ce4ab39.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度智能云于2026世界人工智能大会（WAIC）正式发布无代码应用平台“秒哒”3.5版本。该版本核心升级在于降低开发门槛，新增iOS无代码打包、多端共享后端及数据库多环境隔离功能。iOS打包支持从IPA生成到App Store上架的全流程自动化；多端共享后端允许Web、App、小程序共用同一数据库，实现数据联动。针对开发痛点，秒哒3.5内置SEO Agent实现自动化搜索优化，并支持通过对话生成自定义技能或接入第三方API。此外，平台引入数据库多环境能力，支持开发与线上环境隔离及版本快照回滚，并提供分级后端资源配置以适配不同业务规模。秒哒目前已服务超3500万用户，旨在通过“更简单、更全能”的工具链，让非专业开发者也能完成从创作到交付的闭环。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小红书联手北大上交发布HYPIC，为混合注意力大模型实现位置无关缓存</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e6ad809b9ef7e1a85a6090a69b472f2b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小红书大模型推理团队联合北京大学、上海交通大学提出HYPIC，这是首个针对混合注意力大模型实现位置无关缓存（PIC）的服务系统。针对混合模型中线性层与全注意力层架构，HYPIC通过缓存“转移算子”实现线性层常数时间的状态组合，并利用“缝合窗口”修复全注意力层的跨段对齐，同时引入实例间段并行技术加速长冷请求。在Qwen3.5-35B-A3B等4个生产级模型及5个工作负载的测试中，HYPIC使首token延迟（TTFT）平均降低3.25倍，同SLO下可持续QPS提升1.66倍，且任务质量与完全重算仅相差1.71分。该系统已在SGLang上实现，通过分治策略解决了混合注意力模型难以应用PIC的行业难题，显著提升了RAG与Agent等长上下文场景的推理效率与扩展性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI确认GPT-5.6 Codex存在误删本地文件风险，建议关闭高权限模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1fe23cdbfb2d4e1124d742028d9f7a35.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式确认，由GPT-5.6模型驱动的Codex代码生成系统存在误删用户本地文件的风险。核心产品负责人Tibo Sottiaux指出，该问题主要发生在用户开启“完全访问模式”（full access mode）且未启用沙箱保护机制的情况下。模型在尝试通过覆盖环境变量$HOME设置临时工作目录时，操作异常导致系统误删整个$HOME目录，对macOS和Linux用户造成数据丢失威胁。OpenAI表示，该问题在关闭自动审核功能时更易触发。目前公司正采取修复措施，包括更新权限提示说明及加强系统防护。OpenAI建议正在使用Codex的用户立即关闭高权限模式，改用带安全限制的运行环境。官方计划在未来几天发布详细事故分析报告，披露具体技术原因及改进方案。此外，近期推出的Codex Micro硬件控制面板目前已售罄</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">NVIDIA发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列模型，8B版本登顶RTEB检索基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">NVIDIA正式发布Nemotron 3 Embed系列嵌入向量模型，专为生产级RAG、智能体检索及记忆场景设计。该系列包含8B-BF16、1B-BF16及针对Blackwell架构优化的1B-NVFP4三个版本，均基于Mistral架构，支持32,768 token长上下文及34种语言，并采用OpenMDW-1.1协议开源。在RTEB基准测试中，8B-BF16版本以78.46的平均NDCG@10得分位列榜首。1B版本通过神经架构搜索与知识蒸馏技术构建，其中1B-NVFP4版本在保留99.5%精度的同时，在Blackwell架构上实现了较BF16版本2倍的吞吐量提升。部署方面，8B与1B-BF16支持Transformers及Sentence Transformers框架，1B-NVFP4则通过vLLM 0.2</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
